<title>POLAND: SocGen to lead $150-$200 mln KGHM credit.</title>
<headline>SocGen to lead $150-$200 mln KGHM credit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale will lead a $150 to $200 million three-year multi-currency syndicated loan for the KGHM Polska Miedz SA copper company, KGHM said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the co-organisers were Bankers Trust International PLC, Citibank International PLC, The Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd. and ING Barings.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
